{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.5"
  description: "The other half of the value rule, and the reason it is not simply a relaxation: 0.51 seconds is not a whole number of tenths, so `precision: 1` refuses it and nothing rounds it onto the grid. `at` is admitted, which fixes the pointer on `over`."
  schema: "fixtures/validate-precision.tn"
  error: {
    category: validation
    path: "/over"
  }
}
